    "boundary": "Diagnostic comparison, not a Nanite performance acceptance. The user-specified November 7 ordinary-mesh release and current Nanite-disabled release run serially in isolated Edge processes. Observed cameras, internal/output resolutions, AA and all 14 common published renderer settings match. The old runtime does not publish virtualTextures, virtualTexturePathActive or virtualShadowPathActive; no equality of those implementations is claimed. The initial collector incorrectly required those absent fields; its source is retained. Runtime and cooked geometry differ. This neither isolates a single regression nor explains the earlier 54.85 FPS sample; that raw evidence remains intact. Do not use that sample as the old-version baseline."
  }
